rations on both matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[B\\,|\\,I\\,] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe matrix ${B}^{-1}$ is given by the right-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{B}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-31871/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8a4b135f-df0d-5443-bb93-796f32c380c6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-31871"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-31954/selection/69f7f0a5f32dc8d457ece5e6b86a0c110957e8c887c8156a86ea523d49113dde" :answer/id #uuid "c21085dd-9c94-5fa3-95a1-50de12846340" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{D}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-31954/selection/35a2ea714804aac2b79492dbfd18235c346ca01d0d94a1855c35e8142a55b671" :answer/id #uuid "594a541c-402a-5f3f-b5da-a9ce57d0d03a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{D}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-31954/selection/5ddec4cc21f1af7d2b79256dd43990630428e22896d7e56a3fd10d3ec4c2989c" :answer/id #uuid "94113f1a-7ebc-50f0-a44f-d4404be04496" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{D}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-31954/selection/d2b7dde08ba8d9c4051ef6a633f5db2b91e8fee1de946643ff0c9c3078d883d1" :answer/id #uuid "3f35fb7f-3c9b-5a00-9bad-0d1abfa0477f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{D}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 