e perform the same row operations on both matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[D\\,|\\,I] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe matrix ${D}^{-1}$ is given by the right-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{D}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-31954/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8a4b135f-df0d-5443-bb93-796f32c380c6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-31954"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42987/selection/72ddba9ec3ddc9818a2b3f1c42f04ae1326b6253dadbc9ab5bf9aca1e522bb43" :answer/id #uuid "e22beadd-6fdb-55dc-b9da-17a915b5cc34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{C}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42987/selection/40c74a91b34bf346c292731c2102ba14410d3cf0f8f10fc232ff9c2429741f86" :answer/id #uuid "51423c48-2b3e-5e5e-9a14-21770b17f8e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{C}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 15 & 7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42987/selection/a403cec17ad5b250b50afee0a7f6c3ad39c492c54fae7b48bdc558c53a8be0ce" :answer/id #uuid "b8d9bbff-9305-52a9-91be-99abab6b6f14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{C}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}15 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42987/selection/7f2ad5320e2b94b6ab7325346b00b9c8723149614ff3ba8de0bcc7ad5d05e3b2" :answer/id #uuid "7753a90e-0f4d-5a25-a8ef-0d7aa8de1190" :an