 same row operations on both matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[C\\,|\\,I\\,] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 15 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-7){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 15 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe matrix ${C}^{-1}$ is given by the right-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{C}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}15 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42987/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8a4b135f-df0d-5443-bb93-796f32c380c6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42987"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186115760 :question/answer-fields 17592186113931] {:db/id "q-42988/selection/ma-v1/780e0e7958df6c6edb416b9eef4e603aa25d61b8210ebe034f80a742eb1b48c8/58faf10769982dd9e8b1f631d6e41db4f1d367bd8d2f4f9a80c80ad30339d081" :answer/id #uuid "95786a23-4493-58a7-8fee-47fa72bf02fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42988/selection/ma-v1/780e0e7958df6c6edb416b9eef4e603aa25d61b8210ebe034f80a742eb1b48c8/65492286c916685815a27a1aefe7aba4fb855eea7862ab56161be2d66c248f64" :answer/id #uuid "a3be7fe5-ac31-5b50-a52b-3cb4698ab4cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42988/selection/ma-v1/780e0e7958df6c6edb416b9eef4e603aa25d61b8210ebe034f80a742eb1b48c8/c43678156463b7dedbe620acfbb6fd01273edb38fd9b632f76cc75d5be497adc" :answer/id #uuid "19b41ec3-76e7-57ea-af12-4441dc1425ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 